    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Cyprian Mostert, Assistant Professor and Lead, Mental Health Economist at the Brain and Mind Institute, is changing how mental health is considered in economic policy. With a background in medicine, finance, and policy, Mostert is dedicated to connecting research with policy to make mental well-being a public health priority. In this Q&A, he shares his journey, the challenges of mental health advocacy, and his vision for policies that make a real difference.",
